---
layout: base.njk
title: Prakriti Srimal / Spatial Intelligence
description: Spatial data science, geospatial intelligence and urban sensing. An atlas of investigations across Bengaluru, London, Dubai and four more Indian cities.
---
<a class="skip" href="#tour">Skip to the cities</a>

<header class="chrome">
  <div class="shell chrome-in">
    <a class="mark" href="#top"><b>P/S</b><span>PRAKRITI<br>SPATIAL INTELLIGENCE</span></a>
    <nav class="links">
      <a href="#tour">CITIES</a>
      
      <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="search-btn" id="openSearch" aria-haspopup="dialog">SEARCH ATLAS <kbd>⌘K</kbd></button>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">

<section class="hero">
  <canvas id="heroCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <h1 class="display">Cities are conversations.<br><span class="dim">I listen through data.</span></h1>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn solid" href="#tour">See the cities</a>
          <a class="btn" href="#about">About Prakriti</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tour" id="tour" aria-label="The cities">
  <div class="tour-map" aria-hidden="true">
    <canvas id="tourCanvas"></canvas>
    <div class="scale-readout" aria-live="polite">
      <div>VIEW / <b id="scaleName">EARTH</b></div>
      <div>SCALE / <b id="scaleValue">1:40,000,000</b></div>
      <div>STATE / <b id="scaleState">NATURAL EARTH COASTLINE</b></div>
    </div>
    <nav class="tour-dots" aria-label="Jump to a city">
      {%- for c in cities %}
      <button data-id="{{ c.id }}" aria-current="false"><i></i><span>{{ c.name }}</span></button>
      {%- endfor %}
    </nav>

    <div class="tour-band" id="tourBand" aria-live="polite">
      {%- set c = cities[0] %}
      <div class="tb-head">
        <span class="tb-kicker">{{ c.kicker }}</span>
        <h2 class="tb-name">{{ c.name }}</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="tb-hero">
        <div class="tb-meta"><span class="tb-proj">{{ c.hero.title | upper }}</span><span class="tb-status">{{ c.hero.label }}</span></div>
        <h3 class="tb-q">{{ c.hero.q }}</h3>
        <p class="tb-desc">{{ c.hero.text }}</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="tb-rows"></ol>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tour-track">
    <div class="tour-intro">
      <h2>Exploring cities by changing<br>the scale, the lens,<br>and the question.</h2>
    </div>

    {%- for c in cities %}
    <article class="stop" id="stop-{{ c.id }}">
      <div class="stop-pin">
      <header class="stop-head">
        <span class="stop-kicker">{{ c.kicker }}</span>
        <h2>{{ c.name }}</h2>
      </header>

      {%- set h = c.hero %}
      <div class="stop-hero{% if h.status != 'live' %} is-dim{% endif %}">
        <div class="row-meta"><span>{{ h.title | upper }}</span><span class="status">{{ h.label }}</span></div>
        <h3>{{ h.q }}</h3>
        <p>{{ h.text }}</p>
        {%- if h.href %}<a class="open-link" href="{{ h.href }}">Open the project</a>{% endif %}
      </div>

      {%- if c.analyses.length %}
      <ol class="stop-list">
        {%- for an in c.analyses %}
        <li class="{% if an.status != 'live' %}is-dim{% endif %}">
          {%- if an.href %}<a href="{{ an.href }}">{% else %}<div>{% endif %}
            <span class="row-meta"><span>{{ '0' if loop.index < 10 }}{{ loop.index }}</span><span class="status">{{ an.label }}</span></span>
            <b>{{ an.q }}</b>
            <span class="d">{{ an.text }}</span>
          {%- if an.href %}</a>{% else %}</div>{% endif %}
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ol>
      {%- endif %}

      <footer class="stop-foot">
        {%- if h.href %}<a href="{{ h.href }}">{{ h.title }}<span aria-hidden="true"> &#8599;</span></a>{% else %}<span>{{ h.title }}</span>{% endif %}
        <span class="stop-count">{{ '0' if loop.index < 10 }}{{ loop.index }} / {{ '0' if loop.length < 10 }}{{ loop.length }}</span>
      </footer>
      </div>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
    <div class="tour-tail" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="about">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="about">
      <div>
        <div class="band-head" style="margin-bottom:var(--s5)"><h2>About</h2></div>
        <p>I trained as an architect and stopped drawing buildings when I realised the questions I cared about were about the space between them. Now I work as a spatial data scientist, mostly on cities, mostly with street networks, sensors and whatever the city will let me measure.</p>
        <p>My pattern, for better and worse, is saying yes to something before I fully understand it and then refusing to put it down until I do. That is how a person who had never touched a breadboard ended up building a sensor.</p>
        <div class="contact">
          <a class="btn" href="mailto:prakritisrimal@gmail.com">Email</a>
          <a class="btn" href="https://github.com/psrimal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
          <a class="btn" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/prakriti-srimal-7390ab1a5/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <dl class="facts">
        <div class="fact"><dt>ROLE</dt><dd>Senior Urban Data Scientist, Urban Intelligence Lab, Bengaluru</dd></div>
        <div class="fact"><dt>EDUCATION</dt><dd>MArch Urban Design, UCL Bartlett B-Pro, RC14 Machine Thinking Urbanism, 2023. Architecture, BMS College of Engineering</dd></div>
        <div class="fact"><dt>2026</dt><dd>Nominated for the Sidara Endeavour Program for Scenario Simulator</dd></div>
        <div class="fact"><dt>AWARDS</dt><dd>SEED Chairman Award for Sounds of the City. Gold medal, World Architecture Student Awards 2022. Student Award, Media Architecture Biennale 2023</dd></div>
        <div class="fact"><dt>PUBLISHED IN</dt><dd>ArchDaily, Arch Hive, ArchiDiaries, Inspireli, UCL Bartlett</dd></div>
        <div class="fact"><dt>BASED</dt><dd>Bengaluru, India</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="closing">
  <canvas id="closeCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="shell">
    <h2>Every city leaves evidence.</h2>
    <p>I am still collecting it.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="#tour">Back to the cities</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="shell"><footer>
  <span>PRAKRITI SRIMAL / SPATIAL INTELLIGENCE</span>
  <nav class="foot-links" aria-label="Elsewhere">
    <a href="mailto:prakritisrimal@gmail.com">EMAIL</a>
    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/prakriti-srimal-7390ab1a5/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LINKEDIN</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/psrimal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GITHUB</a>
    <a href="/work/speed-of-a-city/">WRITING</a>
  </nav>
</footer></div>

</main>

